  "sort": 0,
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You call on the magic of the bronze dragonflight and gain the following benefits for the duration.</p><p><strong>Temporal Wounds.</strong> When you move within 5 feet of a creature, you can curse it until the start of your next turn. The next time a cursed creature takes damage, it takes an extra 1d10 Force damage and the curse ends. A creature can be cursed this way only once per turn.</p><p><strong>Wings.</strong> If you don’t already have wings, spectral ones sprout from your back. You have a Fly Speed of 60 feet and can hover, and your movement doesn’t provoke Opportunity Attacks.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
